    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Tune in to the show Part 2</strong></i> continues the story of <i><strong>Tune in to the show</strong></i>. It features the last 15 in-game days and finishes the story of the protagonist and their romantic/lewd adventures in the bizarre house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/952643f455c19c24df7c7e06668ad093.poster.avif?t=1743158407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/952643f455c19c24df7c7e06668ad093.webm?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/952643f455c19c24df7c7e06668ad093.mp4?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's heavily recommended that you play the original first to understand the story and the characters. The game features choices that both change the dialogue and let you choose which of the characters you want to romance (and have sex with). This is a harem story by default, but you can reject any love interests that you aren't interested in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c4ac58a97296091fd7b6b31c40d6d190.poster.avif?t=1743158407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c4ac58a97296091fd7b6b31c40d6d190.webm?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c4ac58a97296091fd7b6b31c40d6d190.mp4?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development, make sure to add it to your wishlist to get the latest news! Also, experience the first half of the story by playing <strong><i>Tune in to the show</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e8ffcfd3fa61635e760f8647a562f6e8.poster.avif?t=1743158407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e8ffcfd3fa61635e760f8647a562f6e8.webm?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e8ffcfd3fa61635e760f8647a562f6e8.mp4?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Tune in to the show Part 2</strong></i> continues the story of <i><strong>Tune in to the show</strong></i>. It features the last 15 in-game days and finishes the story of the protagonist and their romantic/lewd adventures in the bizarre house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/952643f455c19c24df7c7e06668ad093.poster.avif?t=1743158407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/952643f455c19c24df7c7e06668ad093.webm?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/952643f455c19c24df7c7e06668ad093.mp4?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's heavily recommended that you play the original first to understand the story and the characters. The game features choices that both change the dialogue and let you choose which of the characters you want to romance (and have sex with). This is a harem story by default, but you can reject any love interests that you aren't interested in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c4ac58a97296091fd7b6b31c40d6d190.poster.avif?t=1743158407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c4ac58a97296091fd7b6b31c40d6d190.webm?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/c4ac58a97296091fd7b6b31c40d6d190.mp4?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development, make sure to add it to your wishlist to get the latest news! Also, experience the first half of the story by playing <strong><i>Tune in to the show</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e8ffcfd3fa61635e760f8647a562f6e8.poster.avif?t=1743158407\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e8ffcfd3fa61635e760f8647a562f6e8.webm?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588140/extras/e8ffcfd3fa61635e760f8647a562f6e8.mp4?t=1743158407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
